  "contentHtml": "<P><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">경기도 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">학업성적관리규정을 보면</SPAN></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">'동일 학년</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">동일 과목을 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">명 이상의 교사가 담당하고 있을 때는 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;반드시 공동 출제</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">검토</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">편집을 한다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.'</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 는 조항이 있습니다.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>그렇게 하는 이유는</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >&nbsp;1) </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">동일 교과담당교사 간 공동 출제로 학급 간의 성적차를 최소화한다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >&nbsp;2) </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">평가의 오류를 최소화할 수 있다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">미국의 중고등학교 과학</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">교사들도 공동출제를 하는지요?</SPAN></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">갑자기 궁금.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
